output .infobox .infobox-full-data,.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-below{text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-navbar{text-align:right}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4421339\">.mw-parser-output .infobox-subbox{padding:0;border:none;margin:-3px;width:auto;min-width:100%;font-size:100%;clear:none;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .infobox-3cols-child{margin:auto}.mw-parser-output .infobox .navbar{font-size:100%}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-header,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-subheader,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-above,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-title,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-image,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-below{text-align:center}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"background-color: #f6f6f6; color:#000000 min-width: 300px; font-size:small; padding: 5px\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above\" style=\"background-color: #96b9fa; color:inherit; font-size:medium; overflow-wrap: break-word; width:300px;\">Pancakes (North American)</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Banana_on_pancake.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Pancakes\"><img alt=\"Pancakes\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Banana_on_pancake.jpg/330px-Banana_on_pancake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"294\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Banana_on_pancake.jpg/960px-Banana_on_pancake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1664\" data-file-height=\"1632\" /></a></span> </td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Yield</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">12\u201314 pancakes</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Servings</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">3</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Time</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">15 minutes</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Difficulty</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"metadata\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2o5dots.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Easy\"><img alt=\"Easy\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/2o5dots.svg/120px-2o5dots.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/2o5dots.svg/250px-2o5dots.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"12\" /></a></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Table_of_Contents\" title=\"Cookbook:Table of Contents\">Cookbook</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Recipes\" title=\"Cookbook:Recipes\">Recipes</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Ingredients\" title=\"Cookbook:Ingredients\">Ingredients</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Equipment\" title=\"Cookbook:Equipment\">Equipment</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cooking_Techniques\" title=\"Cookbook:Cooking Techniques\">Techniques</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Cookbook_disambiguation_pages\" title=\"Category:Cookbook disambiguation pages\">Cookbook Disambiguation Pages</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Recipes\" title=\"Category:Recipes\">Recipes</a>  <span id=\"displaytitle\" title=\"Recipe\"></span> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Flatbread\" title=\"Cookbook:Flatbread\">Flatbread</a>\n</p><p><b>North American pancakes</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Pancake\" title=\"Cookbook:Pancake\">pancake</a> prepared from a <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Batter\" title=\"Cookbook:Batter\">batter</a> that is baked on a hot griddle or frying pan. They exist in several variations in many different local <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cuisine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Cuisine\">cuisines</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Ingredients\">Ingredients</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Ingredients\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Ingredients\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>120 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Gram\" title=\"Cookbook:Gram\">g</a> (1 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cup\" title=\"Cookbook:Cup\">cup</a> or 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Ounce\" title=\"Cookbook:Ounce\">oz</a>) wheat <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Flour\" title=\"Cookbook:Flour\">flour</a> (white, whole grain or 1:1 mix of white and whole grain)</li>\n<li>1 \u00bd <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Teaspoon\" title=\"Cookbook:Teaspoon\">tsp</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Baking_Powder\" title=\"Cookbook:Baking Powder\">baking powder</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Pinch\" title=\"Cookbook:Pinch\">pinch</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Salt\" title=\"Cookbook:Salt\">salt</a></li>\n<li>250 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Milliliter\" title=\"Cookbook:Milliliter\">ml</a> (1 cup or 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Fluid_Ounce\" title=\"Cookbook:Fluid Ounce\">fl oz</a>) <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Milk\" title=\"Cookbook:Milk\">milk</a> (substitute <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Buttermilk\" title=\"Cookbook:Buttermilk\">buttermilk</a> or 1:1 mix of milk and buttermilk)</li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Eggs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Eggs\">egg</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Separate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Separate\">separated</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Tablespoon\" title=\"Cookbook:Tablespoon\">tbsp</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:White_sugar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:White sugar\">white sugar</a> (optional; this will add a sweetness to your pancakes and is recommended if you are not using any sauces, syrups or ingredient such as bananas or blueberries that will add natural sugars to the mix)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Procedure\">Procedure</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Procedure\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Procedure\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol><li>In a large bowl, mix dry ingredients together until well-blended.</li>\n<li>Add milk and mix well until smooth.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Separate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Separate\">Separate</a> the egg, placing the whites in a medium bowl and the yolks in the batter. Mix batter well.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Whipping\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Whipping\">Whip</a> whites until stiff and then <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Fold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Fold\">fold</a> into batter gently (skip this step for heavier pancakes or if 1 cup buttermilk is substituted for milk).</li>\n<li>Pour ladles of the mixture into a non-stick <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Frying_Pan\" title=\"Cookbook:Frying Pan\">pan</a>, one at a time.</li>\n<li>Cook until the edges are dry and bubbles appear on surface. Flip, then cook until golden.</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Notes,_tips,_and_variations\"><span id=\"Notes.2C_tips.2C_and_variations\"></span>Notes, tips, and variations</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Notes, tips, and variations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Notes, tips, and variations\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Serve with <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Butter\" title=\"Cookbook:Butter\">butter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Maple_Syrup\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Maple Syrup\">maple syrup</a>, fruit, chocolate spread, melted <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Chocolate\" title=\"Cookbook:Chocolate\">chocolate</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Jam\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Jam\">jam</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cheese\" title=\"Cookbook:Cheese\">cheese</a>.</li>\n<li>Many variations of this recipe use a whole <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Beaten_egg\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Beaten egg\">beaten egg</a> instead of the yolk and whipped whites. In these variations, all wet ingredients are mixed together with the dry ingredients to make the batter before moving on to the cooking.</li>\n<li>Use <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Buttermilk\" title=\"Cookbook:Buttermilk\">buttermilk</a> or yogurt instead of milk, or wholegrain flours instead of white. This will change the consistency of the final product\u2014whole grain flours generally lead to a denser heavier pancake, so try mixing white and wheat in various proportions as suggested above to get the feel you want.</li>\n<li>Try adding sliced fruit such as <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Banana\" title=\"Cookbook:Banana\">banana</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Apple\" title=\"Cookbook:Apple\">apple</a>, or broken crispy bacon to the batter after pouring into the skillet and before flipping.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw\u2010web.eqiad.main\u201085dd68f579\u2010trql5\nCached time: 20261121160901\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent\u2010selective\u2010update]\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 276/1000000\nRevision size: 3486/2097152 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 5374/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 467/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 2402/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.017/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 664321/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   78.757      1 -total\n 85.21%   67.106      1 Template:Recipesummary\n 79.03%   62.244      1 Template:Infobox\n 14.69%   11.568      1 Template:Recipe\n 11.12%    8.756      1 Template:Cookbook_page_type\n  2.89%    2.274      1 Template:Displaytitle\n  2.87%    2.260      1 Template:Template_other\n  2.66%    2.092      1 Template:Cooknav\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID dd575d53-e5c5-11f1-86d4-9d05ad9fc82b -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwikibooks:pcache:105063:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261121160901 and revision id 4671208. Rendering was triggered because: page_view\n -->\n</div>"},"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Ingredients","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)","byteoffset":484,"anchor":"Ingredients","linkAnchor":"Ingredients"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Procedure","number":"2","index":"2","fromtitle":"Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)","byteoffset":1318,"anchor":"Procedure","linkAnchor":"Procedure"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Notes, tips, and variations","number":"3","index":"3","fromtitle":"Cookbook:Pancakes_(North_American)","byteoffset":1934,"anchor":"Notes,_tips,_and_variations","linkAnchor":"Notes,_tips,_and_variations"}],"displaytitle":"Cookbook:Pancakes (North American)"}}